WEBVTT

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:32.800
Please, don't leave.

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:35.000
Join us.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.096
We may not be perfect,

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:39.560
but whatever happens,
at least you won't be alone.

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.160
Join "Team Human."

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.256
Find the others.

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:48.240
Together, let's make the future
that we always wanted.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:52.056
Oh, and those tech billionaires
who wanted to know

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:55.336
how to maintain control of their
security force after the apocalypse,

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.256
you know what I told them?

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:01.496
"Start treating those people
with love and respect right now.